  { rt_vdsoinit, at boot: the vDSO's clock_gettime, the way Go's
    vdso_linux.go finds it. AT_SYSINFO_EHDR (33) in the auxiliary vector
    after the environment is the image; its first PT_LOAD gives the load
    offset and PT_DYNAMIC the string table, the symbol table and DT_HASH,
    whose second word is the number of symbols. A defined function named
    __vdso_clock_gettime is the one. Anything missing leaves rt_vdsocgt
    at 0 and rt_now makes the system call. }
  Line('rt_vdsoinit:');
