  { PASLANG_CPU=base in the environment (1.0.126): the program sees the
    baseline processor, SSE2 alone, so every fallback path (V256 as two
    halves, VShuffle8 without pshufb, PopCount without popcnt, XXH3 in
    SSE2) runs on a machine that has more. }
