  { rt_cyclefreq: CycleFreq on amd64, the time-stamp counter's ticks per
    second, worked out once: the counter and the monotonic clock now
    against their values at start, so it waits only when the program is
    younger than 10 ms, and is closer the older it is. cycles * 10^9 / ns
    in 128 bits. Every register but rax kept. }
