    after; under 8 one load of each that stays in its page. They were a
    byte a step. rt_streq's 64-byte loop goes a chunk of 256 KiB at a
    time, rt_strcmp's looks at r9, the next place, every step; between
    two rt_yieldpoint when the routine was asked to stop (P271). }
